 Zombies. Sounds scary? Nothing like this! The general atmosphere is witty and playful.\nThe Private Property brings an exciting and immersive experience for all brave zombie shooters!\n\nDevelopment Note:\nThe game consists of 4 co-op maps and 4 weapon types.", "short_description": "Grab your gun and try to defend the town from the hordes of zombies.\nBecome a deadly gunslinger and test your skill.\nWatch out for special zombies who can treat you with a pipe or exploding dynamite!\nPlay alone or with other players in online mode."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.wenklystudio.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.wenklystudio.com/pp-tos", "publisher_name": "Wenkly Studio Sp. z o.o.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.wenklystudio.com/private-property", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "345643904158212"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2008711389723978"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "903482326054108"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1498912125270238"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1166033945406503"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "796869210006998"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3118955614934855"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1457134652366814"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id":